        "original_id": "6e43398b-ad03-587d-af37-b35f27171411",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alex Wyse, Jessica Stroup, Élodie Yung\n- TV Series: Iron Fist, Daredevil, The Defenders, The Following, 90210, The Bold and the Beautiful\n- Productions: Spring Awakening, Marvel Cinematic Universe\n- Roles: Kyle, Saul Feinberg, Georg Zirschnitz, Erin Silver, Max Hardy, Joy Meachum, Elektra Natchios\n\nFacts:\n- Jessica Stroup was born on October 23, 1986, and is an American actress.\n- In 2015, Alex Wyse played Georg Zirschnitz in the Deaf West Broadway revival of Spring Awakening.\n- Alex Wyse is best known for playing Kyle in Marvel's Iron Fist and Saul Feinberg in The Bold and the Beautiful.\n- Iron Fist is set in the Marvel Cinematic Universe and shares continuity with the franchise's films.\n- Iron Fist is the fourth in a series of shows that lead to The Defenders crossover miniseries.\n- Jessica Stroup is best known for playing Erin Silver on 90210, Max Hardy on The Following, and Joy Meachum in Iron Fist.\n- Élodie Yung is best known for playing Elektra Natchios in the second season of Daredevil and in The Defenders.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
